agg BernoulliFrequency .8 claims sev.UnitSeverity bernoulli note{Bernoulli claim count} tags{topic:frequency};
agg BinomialFrequency 10 claims dsev [1] binomial 0.5 note{Bounded claim count -- binomial (here n = 20, p = 0.5).} tags{topic:frequency};
agg BinomialSimple 10 claims sev.UnitSeverity binomial 0.5 note{binomial n=10, p=1/2 claim count} tags{topic:frequency};
