agg GeometricFrequency 10 claims sev.UnitSeverity geometric note{geometric claim count} tags{topic:frequency};
agg MixedGammaFrequency 100 claims 1000 xs 0 sev lognorm 100 cv 1.5 mixed gamma 0.4 note{Same severity, over-dispersed counts (gamma-mixed Poisson = negative binomial).} tags{topic:frequency};
agg MixedSeverityAndFrequency [5 10 8 2] claims [1 5 10 20] xs 0 sev lognorm 10 cv 1.2 mixed gamma 0.2 note{Limit profile, single severity.} tags{topic:severity, topic:frequency};
agg NegativeBinomialFrequency 10 claims sev.UnitSeverity negbin 3 note{negative binomial; shape parameter 3 equals variance multiplier} tags{topic:frequency};
agg NegativeBinomialMixed 10 claims sev.UnitSeverity mixed gamma 0.65 note{negative binomial as gamma mixed Poisson, shape parameter equals cv of mixing distribution} tags{topic:frequency};
