agg ZMPoissonFrequency 4 claims dsev [1] poisson zm 0.5 note{Zero-modified Poisson -- inflate the no-claim probability to 0.5. The 4 is the UN-MODIFIED base mean; reweighting leaves E[N] = 2.0373. Append ! to pin E[N] = 4 instead.} tags{topic:frequency};
agg ZMPoissonSimple 4 claims dsev [1] poisson zt note{zero truncated Poisson with mean 4} tags{topic:frequency};
agg ZTPoissonFrequency 4 claims dsev [1] poisson zt note{Zero-truncated Poisson -- at least one claim, so E[N] = 4/(1-exp(-4)) = 4.0746.} tags{topic:frequency};
agg ZTPoissonSimple 4 claims dsev [1] poisson zm .5 note{zero modified Poisson} tags{topic:frequency};

